{
  "slug": "worker-k",
  "name": "Worker K",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI workforce skills for office automation — Excel, Word, PDF, research, bank reconciliation, and more. Built for accounting and professional service firms. 8 specialized skills that turn Claude Code into a capable office assistant: create and  analyze spreadsheets, generate Word documents, extract data from PDFs, conduct structured  research on tax/audit/regulatory topics, automate bank reconciliations, parse claim forms,   and update audit letters.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `bank-reconciliation` (Generate monthly bank reconciliation statements comparing bank statement balance to cash book balance), `claim-form-extraction` (Extract and process data from claim forms (expense claims, insurance claims, medical claims, staff reimbursements, petty cash claims)), `excel-processing` (Create, read, edit, and analyze Excel spreadsheets (.xlsx/.xls/.csv)), `management-rep-letter` (Update management representation letter templates with firm and client details), `pdf-processing` (Extract text and tables from PDF files, fill forms, merge/split PDFs, convert PDFs, add watermarks, and generate PDF…), `research` (Conduct thorough research and analysis on accounting, tax, audit, advisory, regulatory, and business topics), `web-browse` (Browse websites, scrape web content, automate web interactions, and capture screenshots using Playwright), `word-processing` (Create, read, edit, and format Word documents (.docx))\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install worker-k@claude-community` from `WeiKhjan/worker-k`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
